  "message_id": "MSG_000",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}＞前方的路被封锁了……\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e712_451.bf.json:1:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 02 01 02 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 02 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}你们跨越原野与高山，\n摆脱无数宿敌与恶魔，\n终于来到了这里。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e712_451.bf.json:1:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_001",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}你们的口中，\n不禁漏出安心的叹息。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e712_451.bf.json:2:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_002",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}倒是没有叹气……\n不过，确实走了很长一段路呢。\n{F2 23 79 01}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e712_451.bf.json:3:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_003",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 04 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}即使问题还在继续，\n你们也一定\n能够克服吧。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e712_451.bf.json:4:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_004",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 07 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 09 01}{F5 C1 03 01 01 01 01 01 0A 01}啊……竟然还有。\n{F2 23 3D 01}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e712_451.bf.json:5:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_0042",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 0D 01 01 01 01 01}{F1 25}{F5 C1 12 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}　\n{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}不过，确实已经到很深的地方了，\n要更加小心。\n{F2 23 79 01}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e712_451.bf.json:5:1",
  "message_id": "MSG_0042",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 86 03 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 01 01}那个“守卫”差不多\n也该出现了。\n{F2 23 79 01}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e712_451.bf.json:6:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_005",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 05 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}那么，第九问来了。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}{00}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e712_451.bf.json:7:0",
  "message_id": "MSG_006",
  "translation": "{F2 05 FF FF}{F1 41}{F5 61 02 01 01 01 01 01 06 01}{F5 C1 04 01 01 01 01 01 03 01}跋山涉水来到这里的你们，\n口中不断漏出\n安心的叹息。\n{F2 23 00 00}{F1 21}"
 },
 {
  "key": "export_base/event/e700/e712_451.bf.json:7:1",
